{"sections":[{"slug":"几何Langlands对应","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"几何Langlands对应"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"几何 Langlands 对应"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">经典对应</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对应是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Langlands对应","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">经典</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/函数域类比","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">函数域类比</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">以及其在复代数曲线</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann面","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">上的进一步类比</span>.</p>\n<p>todo: <span lang=\"zh\">重写</span></p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Galois表示","text":"Galois <span lang=\"zh\">表示</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">理解为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/l-进局部系统","text":"$\\ell$-<span lang=\"zh\">进层</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">非分歧</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自守表示","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自守表示</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">给出</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n(F) \\backslash \\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathbb A) / \\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathcal O)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的函数</span> $f_\\pi$ (<span lang=\"zh\">差一个常数</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">它是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hecke代数","text":"Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal H_x, x\\in X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的特征函数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">使用</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Grothendieck函数–层字典","text":"Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">层字典</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">该函数对应于</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">丛模空间上的</span> Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">特征层</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">范畴层面的对应</span></h3>\n<p>“<span lang=\"zh\">范畴式</span>” (categorical) <span lang=\"zh\">几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对应的主旨是两个</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/微分分次范畴","text":"DG <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的比较</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">几何</span> (“<span lang=\"zh\">自守</span>”) <span lang=\"zh\">侧</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">丛的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/D-模","text":"D-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">谱</span> (“Galois”) <span lang=\"zh\">侧</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span> $\\check G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部系统","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部系统</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的叠上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">物理视角</span>: Kapustin–Witten</h3>\n<p>2006 <span lang=\"zh\">年</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/KapustinWittenGL","text":"Kapustin <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> Witten"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">指出</span> 4D <span lang=\"zh\">超对称规范场论的</span> S <span lang=\"zh\">对偶能够推出几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对偶群</span> $G,G^L$, <span lang=\"zh\">分别考虑代数曲线</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上对应的</span> Higgs <span lang=\"zh\">丛的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hitchin模叠","text":"Hitchin <span lang=\"zh\">模叠</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">人们认识到几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">纲领与该几何对象的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同调镜像对称","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同调镜像对称</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">有关</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/量子几何Langlands纲领","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">量子几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">纲领</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}